abstract: >-
  MATLAB function, which also runs in GNU Octave, computing the static displacements of the surface of a homogeneous
  elastic half-space caused by the slip on a rectangular fault, strike slip and dip slip combined by the rake, by the
  closed-form solution of Okada (1985); a vertical fault is computed with the expressions of Okada (1992) for a zero
  cosine of the dip. Such co-seismic displacements serve to build the initial conditions of codes of tsunami
  propagation.
